                                                "sense_id": "9cf936a6-b8e9-39dd-954d-d7014eaa47ff",
                                                "text": "I remember, when he was in Scotland, his praising ‘Gordon's palates’ (a dish of palates at the Honourable Alexander Gordon's) with a warmth of expression which might have done for honour to more important subjects."
